{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50986","headline":"赠谭先生 · 杨徽之","name":"赠谭先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古观重重遶翠微，杉松深处掩双扉。\n云生万壑投龙去，海隔三山放鹤归。\n花洞宴游春日永，石坛朝礼曙星稀。\n每听高论长生理，拟向尘中便拂衣。\n（见《瀛奎律髓》卷四十八《仙逸类》。\n此诗明李蔉所辑《宋艺圃集》作李九龄诗。\n按徽之又有《禁林讌会之什》一首见於《翰苑羣书》者，系入禋後所作，不收录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨徽之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}